{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"ALSA-2026:42089","published":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-07-21T13:00:03.853575964Z","related":["CVE-2026-58016"],"summary":"Important: glib2 security update","details":"GLib provides the core application building blocks for libraries and applications written in C. It provides the core object system used in GNOME, the main loop implementation, and a large set of utility functions for strings and common data structures.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * glib: integer underflow in gio/gdbusintrospection.c via \"g_dbus_node_info_new_for_xml\" (CVE-2026-58016)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"glib2","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/glib2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.68.4-19.el9_8.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:42089.json"}},{"package":{"name":"glib2-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/glib2-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.68.4-19.el9_8.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:42089.json"}},{"package":{"name":"glib2-doc","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/glib2-doc"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.68.4-19.el9_8.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:42089.json"}},{"package":{"name":"glib2-static","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/glib2-static"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.68.4-19.el9_8.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://githu